{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "612e99a3-9457-840e-b486-b3d002ccdc35",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T13:04:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:57:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 34,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. My name is Theresa Iannuccilli, that's I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I, and I hope I'm not catching you at lunch. I've lived on the Hill a long time, and I walk to the market most mornings, so I notice things. And I wanted to ask about something in the street, because it's been going on a couple of weeks now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem at all. What's going on in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:58:05-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a manhole cover that has sunk down. It's lower than the pavement around it, and every time a car goes over it, it rings. Like a clang, a metal ring, bang bang. Delivery trucks are the worst."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:58:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I know the sound. Okay, and where is this? What's the street address or closest address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:58:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my house, 462 Ayrault Street. Right in the road, near the curb on my side, maybe four feet out from it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:58:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ayrault, 462. Got it. And you said the cover itself has sunk, so it sits below the road surface?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:59:05-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The pavement around it has a lip, so the cover is down maybe an inch or two. I'm not good with measuring. And the ring is what I hear from the house, even with the windows closed. [pause] I'm sorry, I'm holding the phone close, I don't want the neighbor to hear me. She's right outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're a little muffled, like you're talking into your hand. Can you say that last part again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:59:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said the neighbor is out front. I'll keep going. The phone's on the kitchen wall, so I can't walk away with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:00:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear you okay. Is it a sewer manhole or something else, do you know? Any lettering on the cover?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:00:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I couldn't tell you. It's round, iron, and it has a pattern of little squares. I didn't go out and read it, with the traffic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good enough. Has any car been damaged, or has anyone tripped on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody has been hurt that I know of. Just the noise, and I worry it'll get worse. I did take photographs with my daughter's old camera phone. I have a couple, from the sidewalk and one up close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, photos help. If you can email them in, I'll tell you where. Or are you not set up for email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:01:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not much for email. Could they be sent some other way? Or could I bring them in printed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can drop prints at the Public Works counter, or the crew will look at it on site anyway. The photos are a bonus. I'll note that you have them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:01:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, I'll note that I have them too. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:01:53-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a request now. Ayrault Street, 462, sunken manhole cover that rings under traffic. Can I get a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:02:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-seven. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:02:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And could I have a reference number, please? So if I call back I can say which one it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Give me a second, it's generating. [pause] Okay, your reference number is PW-26-0303-14. Do you want to write that down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:02:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, let me get a pencil. [pause] All right. PW, then 26?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, dash, two-six, dash, zero-three-zero-three, dash, one-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW-26-0303-14. Got it. I'll put it by the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:03:02-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Crews are usually out to look at these within a week or two, depending on what else is going on. If it turns out to be a utility cover, it might get passed along to the right group, but you won't need to do anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And will someone call me before they come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not always. They may just show up and look, since it's in the street. If they need to reach you, they have your number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll be home most days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:03:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you for your time, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Iannuccilli. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:04:08-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
